
  Short help                                 
         
  USAGE  
         
  ╭─────────────────────────────────────╮
  │  example [command] [--flags]        │
  ╰─────────────────────────────────────╯
            
  EXAMPLES  
            
  ╭─────────────────────────────────────╮
  │  # Run it:                          │
  │  example                            │
  │                                     │
  │  # Run it with some arguments:      │
  │  FOO=bar ZAZ="quoted value" examp…  │
  │                                     │
  │  # Run a subcommand with an argum…  │
  │  example sub --async --name=xyz -…  │
  │                                     │
  │  # Run with a quoted string:        │
  │  example sub "quoted string"        │
  │                                     │
  │  # Mix and match:                   │
  │  example sub "multi-word quoted s…  │
  │                                     │
  │  # Multi-line:                      │
  │  ENV_A=0 ENV_B=0 ENV_C=0 \          │
  │    CERT_FILE=/path/to/chain.pem K…  │
  │    example sub "quoted argument"    │
  │                                     │
  │  # Run a subcommand's subcommand …  │
  │  example sub another args --async   │
  │                                     │
  │  # Pipe example:                    │
  │  echo "foo" | example > bar.txt     │
  │                                     │
  │  # Redirects:                       │
  │  example < in.txt > out.txt         │
  │  example 2>&1 1>/dev/null           │
  │  example 1>&2 2>/dev/null           │
  │                                     │
  │  # And / Or:                        │
  │  foo || example                     │
  │  example && foo                     │
  │                                     │
  │  # Another pipe example:            │
  │  echo 'foo' |                       │
  │    example sub |                    │
  │    cat -                            │
  ╰─────────────────────────────────────╯
            
  COMMANDS  
            
    completion [command]  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
    help [command]        Help about any command
    sub                   A sub command
         
  FLAGS  
         
    -a --async            Async?
    -h --help             Help for example
       --name             The name
    -s --surname          The surname
    -v --version          Version for example

